<title>POLAND: Gdanski to vote on merger on June 27.</title>
<headline>Gdanski to vote on merger on June 27.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Bank Gdanski SA will vote on June 27 on its merger with Bank Inicjatyw Gospodraczych SA (BIG), Gdanski said in s statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Earlier on Wednesday BIG said it wanted to offer Gdanski shareholders 11 new BIG shares for each Gdanski share to effect the bank's merger.</p>
<p>BIG said its shareholders would vote on June 26 on a new issue of 215,732,000 shares, to be exchanged for shares in its current 63.4-percent-owned subsidiary Bank Gdanski.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
